  "rules": {
    "direction": "Higher priority wins: F:/WorkDir/CoA64/Engine/Source/BlizzardCore/Source/Packages/Mopaq/MPQGlobals.cpp:14-20 sorts archives by m_priority, highest first.",
    "patch-sorted": "Data\\patch-*.MPQ and Data\\<locale>\\patch-<locale>-?.MPQ are listed together and sorted descending by full path, case-insensitive (F:/WorkDir/CoA64/WoW/Source/WowServices/PatchFiles.cpp:33-34, :55-77, compare at :9-11). OpenArchives walks that list backwards with priority rising from 64 (F:/WorkDir/CoA64/WoW/Source/Client.cpp:1415, :1420-1428), after the two archives below, so these take 66 upward in ascending path order and the last by name wins.",
    "patch-single": "Data\\patch.MPQ, then Data\\<locale>\\patch-<locale>.MPQ, are appended after the sort (PatchFiles.cpp:35-36, pass 1 at :55-77), so the backwards walk opens patch-<locale>.MPQ first at 64 and patch.MPQ next at 65 (Client.cpp:1420-1428).",
    "patch-hd": "As patch-sorted (priority from the same sort). Also one of the eight HD archives that -hd 0 refuses, so on a -hd 0 client it doesn't load at all: F:/WorkDir/ascension-extensions-reconstruction/src/Ascension/AscRealmData.cpp:311-312; Data\\patch-Q.MPQ also sets the HD flag at :318.",
    "base-table": "Slot in s_archives (F:/WorkDir/CoA64/WoW/Source/Client.cpp:167-196). OpenArchives starts basePriority at 63 and drops it by one per table entry, present on disk or not, skipping alternate and streaming entries (Client.cpp:1465, :1468-1474, :1508).",
    "realm": "Named by Data\\<realm>\\listarchive and opened from priority 0x200 upward, above every base and patch archive, only while that realm's data path is active: F:/WorkDir/ascension-extensions-reconstruction/src/Ascension/AscRealmData.cpp:3-5, :204-213. D:/WoW/Coa/Data/area-52/listarchive names patch-D.MPQ.",
    "not-opened": "Not in s_archives (Client.cpp:167-196) and not matched by any patch pattern (PatchFiles.cpp:33-44). The client only checks its stock size in F:/WorkDir/CoA64/WoW/Source/Ui/BugReport.cpp:56-57. Below zero: never a winning copy.",
    "origin": "patch-B.MPQ and patch-T.MPQ are project-built: D:/WoW/Coa/CLIENT-RELEASE.json and README.txt (revision 8). Everything else stays unknown until the owner confirms it; F:/WorkDir/CoA64/WoW/Source/Ui/BugReport.cpp:45-57 lists stock sizes for some archives, but that is not treated as proof of origin here."
  },
